From 87a6b11ed756814289a00ff91240d933fc8b5902 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vector-local-brain contributors <noreply@example.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] step6: conversation mode up to 100 turns + kill phrase
 + conversation-timeout baseline fix

The follow-up timeout was measured from the start of the round trip
(including TTS playback) instead of from the end of speech, so long
replies ate the whole listening window.
